## 7. Action Plan for a Complete Beginner
```markdown
Step 1: Focus on US-resonant audio and content topics first.
Step 2: Post at US peak hours regardless of your local timezone.
Step 3: Check Instagram Insights > Audience > Regions to confirm US distribution.
Step 4: Only upgrade to a US eSIM after confirming content reaches US audiences organically.
```

